- Full request-signing pipeline decoded: base64url(`client_private_key`) → PKCS#8 parse → hex-decode server ECDH pubkey → combine_fn `c0d70f0` → 32B secret → domain-separated HMAC (`whale:hmac:`+`v1`)
- combine_fn `c0d70f0` has exactly 2 callers: signing fn `c0d4770` + version-gated consumer `c4dec5c`
- 9 Whale-specific sync source files confirmed in binary: `whale_sync_auth_manager.cc`, `trusted_vault_request_whale.cc`, `sync_service_impl_whale.cc`, `sync_stopped_reporter_whale.cc`, `data_type_worker_whale.cc`, `sync_server_connection_manager_whale.cc`, `whale_sync_util.cc`, plus 2 more under `../../whale/components/sync/`
